dsh-next-actions
=================

Third-party notices for portions adapted from other works.


DeepSeek Harness official action card
-------------------------------------

The suggestion card and process row follow the DeepSeek Harness official
action card. Portions of client.js — the card and process-row CSS, and the
markup structure they style — are adapted from that work, with renamed
`dshna-` class names and DSH theme-token references.

